{"page":283,"verses":[{"verse_key":"17:8","surah":17,"ayah":8,"ar_uthmani":"عَسَىٰ رَبُّكُمْ أَن يَرْحَمَكُمْ ۚ وَإِنْ عُدتُّمْ عُدْنَا ۘ وَجَعَلْنَا جَهَنَّمَ لِلْكَـٰفِرِينَ حَصِيرًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Your Lord may yet have mercy on you, but if you do the same again, so shall We: We have made Hell a prison for those who defy [Our warning].","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"عَسَىٰ","en_gloss":"(It) may be","transliteration":"ʿasā","verse_key":"17:8"},{"pos":2,"ar":"رَبُّكُمْ","en_gloss":"that your Lord","transliteration":"rabbukum","verse_key":"17:8"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that your Lord","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"17:8"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يَرْحَمَكُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"(may) have mercy upon you","transliteration":"yarḥamakum","verse_key":"17:8"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَإِنْ","en_gloss":"But if","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"17:8"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عُدتُّمْ","en_gloss":"you return","transliteration":"ʿudttum","verse_key":"17:8"},{"pos":7,"ar":"عُدْنَا ۘ","en_gloss":"We will return","transliteration":"ʿud'nā","verse_key":"17:8"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَجَعَلْنَا","en_gloss":"And We have made","transliteration":"wajaʿalnā","verse_key":"17:8"},{"pos":9,"ar":"جَهَنَّمَ","en_gloss":"Hell","transliteration":"jahannama","verse_key":"17:8"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لِلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","en_gloss":"for the disbelievers","transliteration":"lil'kāfirīna","verse_key":"17:8"},{"pos":11,"ar":"حَصِيرًا","en_gloss":"a prison-bed","transliteration":"ḥaṣīran","verse_key":"17:8"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٨","en_gloss":"(8)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"17:8"}]},{"verse_key":"17:9","surah":17,"ayah":9,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّ هَـٰذَا ٱلْقُرْءَانَ يَهْدِى لِلَّتِى هِىَ أَقْوَمُ وَيُبَشِّرُ ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ ٱلَّذِينَ يَعْمَلُونَ ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ أَنَّ لَهُمْ أَجْرًا كَبِيرًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"This Quran does indeed show the straightest way. It gives the faithful who do right the good news that they will have a great reward and","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","translitera