loss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"17:10"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"17:10"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"yu'minūna","verse_key":"17:10"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","en_gloss":"in the Hereafter","transliteration":"bil-ākhirati","verse_key":"17:10"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَعْتَدْنَا","en_gloss":"We have prepared","transliteration":"aʿtadnā","verse_key":"17:10"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"17:10"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عَذَابًا","en_gloss":"a punishment","transliteration":"ʿadhāban","verse_key":"17:10"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أَلِيمًۭا","en_gloss":"painful","transliteration":"alīman","verse_key":"17:10"},{"pos":10,"ar":"١٠","en_gloss":"(10)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"17:10"}]},{"verse_key":"17:11","surah":17,"ayah":11,"ar_uthmani":"وَيَدْعُ ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ بِٱلشَّرِّ دُعَآءَهُۥ بِٱلْخَيْرِ ۖ وَكَانَ ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ عَجُولًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Yet man prays for harm, just as he prays for good: man is ever hasty.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَيَدْعُ","en_gloss":"And prays","transliteration":"wayadʿu","verse_key":"17:11"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ","en_gloss":"the man","transliteration":"l-insānu","verse_key":"17:11"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بِٱلشَّرِّ","en_gloss":"for evil","transliteration":"bil-shari","verse_key":"17:11"},{"pos":4,"ar":"دُعَآءَهُۥ","en_gloss":"(as) he prays","transliteration":"duʿāahu","verse_key":"17:11"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِٱلْخَيْرِ ۖ","en_gloss":"for the good","transliteration":"bil-khayri","verse_key":"17:11"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَكَانَ","en_gloss":"And is","transliteration":"wakāna","verse_key":"17:11"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ","en_gloss":"the man","transliteration":"l-insānu","verse_key":"17:11"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عَجُولًۭا","en_gloss":"ever hasty","transliteration":"ʿajūlan","verse_key":"17:11"},{"pos":9,"ar":"١١","en_gloss":"(11)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"17:11"}]},{"verse_key":"17:12","surah":17,"ayah":12,"ar_uthmani":"وَجَعَلْنَا ٱلَّيْلَ وَٱلنَّهَارَ ءَايَتَيْنِ ۖ فَمَحَوْنَآ ءَايَةَ ٱلَّيْلِ وَجَعَلْنَآ ءَايَةَ ٱلنَّهَارِ مُبْصِرَةً لِّتَبْتَغُوا۟ فَضْلًا مِّن رَّبِّكُمْ وَلِتَعْلَمُوا۟ عَدَدَ ٱلسِّنِينَ وَٱلْحِسَابَ ۚ وَكُلَّ شَىْءٍ فَصَّلْنَـٰهُ تَفْصِيلًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We made the night and the day as two signs, then darkened the night and made the daylight for seeing, for you to seek your Lord’s bounty and to know how to count the years and calculate. We have explained everything in detail.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَجَعَلْنَا","en_gloss":"And We have made","transliteration":"wajaʿalnā","verse_key":"17:12"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّيْلَ","en_gloss":"the night","transliteration":"al-layla","verse_key":"17:12"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَٱلنَّهَارَ","en_gloss":"and the day","transliteration":"wal-nahāra","verse_key":"17:12"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ءَايَتَيْنِ ۖ","en_gloss":"(as) two signs","transliteration":"āyatayni","verse_key":"17:12"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فَمَحَوْنَآ","en_gloss":"Then We erased","transliteration":"famaḥawnā","verse_key":"17:12"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ءَايَةَ","en_gloss":"(the) sign","transliteration":"āyata","verse_key":"17:12"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلَّيْلِ","en_gloss":"(of) the night","transliteration":"al-layli","verse_key":"17:12"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَجَعَلْنَآ","en_gloss":"and We made","transliteration":"wajaʿalnā","verse_key":"17:12"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ءَايَةَ","en_gloss":"(the) sign","transliteration":"āyata","verse_key":"17:12"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلنَّهَارِ","en_gloss":"(of) the day","transliteration":"l-nahāri","verse_key":"17:12"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مُبْصِرَةًۭ","en_gloss":"visible","transliteration":"mub'ṣiratan","verse_key":"17:12"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لِّتَبْتَغُوا۟","en_gloss":"that you may seek","transliteration":"litabtaghū","verse_key":"17:12"},{"pos":13,"ar":"فَضْلًۭا","en_gloss":"bounty","transliteration":"faḍlan","verse_key":"17:12"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"17:12"},{"pos":15,"ar":"