"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَنُخْرِجُ","en_gloss":"and We will bring forth","transliteration":"wanukh'riju","verse_key":"17:13"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لَهُۥ","en_gloss":"for him","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"17:13"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يَوْمَ","en_gloss":"(on the) Day","transliteration":"yawma","verse_key":"17:13"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ","en_gloss":"(of) the Resurrection","transliteration":"l-qiyāmati","verse_key":"17:13"},{"pos":11,"ar":"كِتَـٰبًۭا","en_gloss":"a record","transliteration":"kitāban","verse_key":"17:13"},{"pos":12,"ar":"يَلْقَىٰهُ","en_gloss":"which he will find","transliteration":"yalqāhu","verse_key":"17:13"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مَنشُورًا","en_gloss":"wide open","transliteration":"manshūran","verse_key":"17:13"},{"pos":14,"ar":"١٣","en_gloss":"(13)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"17:13"}]},{"verse_key":"17:14","surah":17,"ayah":14,"ar_uthmani":"ٱقْرَأْ كِتَـٰبَكَ كَفَىٰ بِنَفْسِكَ ٱلْيَوْمَ عَلَيْكَ حَسِيبًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"‘Read your record. Today your own soul is enough to calculate your account.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱقْرَأْ","en_gloss":"Read","transliteration":"iq'ra","verse_key":"17:14"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كِتَـٰبَكَ","en_gloss":"your record","transliteration":"kitābaka","verse_key":"17:14"},{"pos":3,"ar":"كَفَىٰ","en_gloss":"Sufficient","transliteration":"kafā","verse_key":"17:14"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بِنَفْسِكَ","en_gloss":"(is) yourself","transliteration":"binafsika","verse_key":"17:14"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْيَوْمَ","en_gloss":"today","transliteration":"l-yawma","verse_key":"17:14"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عَلَيْكَ","en_gloss":"against you","transliteration":"ʿalayka","verse_key":"17:14"},{"pos":7,"ar":"حَسِيبًۭا","en_gloss":"(as) accountant","transliteration":"ḥasīban","verse_key":"17:14"},{"pos":8,"ar":"١٤","en_gloss":"(14)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"17:14"}]},{"verse_key":"17:15","surah":17,"ayah":15,"ar_uthmani":"مَّنِ ٱهْتَدَىٰ فَإِنَّمَا يَهْتَدِى لِنَفْسِهِۦ ۖ وَمَن ضَلَّ فَإِنَّمَا يَضِلُّ عَلَيْهَا ۚ وَلَا تَزِرُ وَازِرَةٌ وِزْرَ أُخْرَىٰ ۗ وَمَا كُنَّا مُعَذِّبِينَ حَتَّىٰ نَبْعَثَ رَسُولًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Whoever accepts guidance does so for his own good; whoever strays does so at his own peril. No soul will bear another’s burden, nor do We punish until We have sent a messenger.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"مَّنِ","en_gloss":"Whoever","transliteration":"mani","verse_key":"17:15"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱهْتَدَىٰ","en_gloss":"(is) guided","transliteration":"ih'tadā","verse_key":"17:15"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فَإِنَّمَا","en_gloss":"then only","transliteration":"fa-innamā","verse_key":"17:15"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يَهْتَدِى","en_gloss":"he is guided","transliteration":"yahtadī","verse_key":"17:15"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لِنَفْسِهِۦ ۖ","en_gloss":"for his soul","transliteration":"linafsihi","verse_key":"17:15"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَمَن","en_gloss":"And whoever","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"17:15"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ضَلَّ","en_gloss":"goes astray","transliteration":"ḍalla","verse_key":"17:15"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَإِنَّمَا","en_gloss":"then only","transliteration":"fa-innamā","verse_key":"17:15"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يَضِلُّ","en_gloss":"he goes astray","transliteration":"yaḍillu","verse_key":"17:15"},{"pos":10,"ar":"عَلَيْهَا ۚ","en_gloss":"against it","transliteration":"ʿalayhā","verse_key":"17:15"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"17:15"},{"pos":12,"ar":"تَزِرُ","en_gloss":"will bear","transliteration":"taziru","verse_key":"17:15"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَازِرَةٌۭ","en_gloss":"a bearer of burden","transliteration":"wāziratun","verse_key":"17:15"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وِزْرَ","en_gloss":"burden","transliteration":"wiz'ra","verse_key":"17:15"},{"pos":15,"ar":"أُخْرَىٰ ۗ","en_gloss":"(of) another","transliteration":"ukh'rā","verse_key":"17:15"},{"pos":16,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"17:15"},{"pos":17,"ar":"كُنَّا","en_gloss":"We","transliteration":"kunnā","verse_key":"17:15"},{"pos":18,"ar":"مُعَذِّبِينَ","en_gloss":"are to punish","transliteration":"muʿadhibīna","verse_key":"17:15"},{"pos":19,"ar":"حَتَّىٰ","en_gloss":"until","transliteration":"ḥattā","verse_key":"17:15"},{"pos":20,"ar":"نَبْعَثَ","en_gloss":"We have sent","transliteration":"nabʿatha","verse_key":"17:15"},{"pos":21,"ar":"رَسُولًۭا","en_gloss":"a Messenger","transliteration":"rasūlan","verse_key":"17:15"},{"pos":22,"ar":"١٥","en_gloss":"(15)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"17:15"}]},{"verse_key":"17:16","surah":17,"ayah":16,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِذَآ أَرَدْنَآ أَن نُّهْلِكَ قَرْيَةً أَمَرْنَا مُتْرَفِيهَا فَفَسَقُوا۟ فِيهَا فَحَقَّ عَلَيْهَا ٱلْقَوْلُ فَدَمَّرْنَـٰهَا تَدْمِيرًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"When We decide to destroy a town, We command those corrupted by wealth [to reform], but they [persist in their] disobedience; Our sentence is passed, and We destroy them utterly.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذَآ","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idhā","verse_key":"17:16"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَرَدْنَآ","en_gloss":"We intend","transliteration":"aradnā","verse_key":"17:16"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"17:16"},{"pos":4,"ar":"نُّهْلِكَ","en_gloss":"We destroy","transliteration":"nuh'lika","verse_key":"17:16"},{"pos":5,"ar":"قَرْيَةً","en_gloss":"a town","transliteration":"qaryatan","verse_key":"17:16"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَمَرْنَا","en_gloss":"We order","transliteration":"amarnā","verse_key":"17:16"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مُتْرَفِيهَا","en_gloss":"its wealthy people","transliteration":"mut'rafīhā","verse_key":"17:16"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَفَسَقُوا۟","en_gloss":"but they defiantly disobey","transliteration":"fafasaqū","verse_key":"17:16"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فِيهَا","en_gloss":"therein","transliteration":"fīhā","verse_key":"17:16"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فَحَقَّ","en_gloss":"so (is) proved true","transliteration":"faḥaqqa","verse_key":"17:16"},{"pos":11,"ar":"عَلَيْهَا","en_gloss":"against it","transliteration":"ʿalayhā","verse_key":"17:16"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْقَوْلُ","en_gloss":"the word","transliteration":"l-qawlu","verse_key":"17:16"},{"pos":13,"ar":"فَدَمَّرْنَـٰهَا","en_gloss":"and We destroy it","transliteration":"fadammarnāhā","verse_key":"17:16"},{"pos":14,"ar":"تَدْمِيرًۭا","en_gloss":"(with) destruction","transliteration":"tadmīran","verse_key":"17:16"},{"pos":15,"ar":"١٦","en_gloss":"(16)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"17:16"}]},{"verse_key":"17:17","surah":17,"ayah":17,"ar_uthmani":"وَكَمْ أَهْلَكْنَا مِنَ ٱلْقُرُونِ مِنۢ بَعْدِ نُوحٍ ۗ وَكَفَىٰ بِرَبِّكَ بِذُنُوبِ عِبَادِهِۦ خَبِيرًۢا بَصِيرًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"How many generations We have destroyed since Noah! Your Lord knows and observes the sins of His servants well enough.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَكَمْ","en_gloss":"And how many","transliteration":"wakam","verse_key":"17:17"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَهْلَكْنَا","en_gloss":"We destroyed","transliteration":"ahlaknā","verse_key":"17:17"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"17:17"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْقُرُونِ","en_gloss":"the generations","transliteration":"l-qurūni","verse_key":"17:17"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِنۢ","en_gloss":"after","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"17:17"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بَعْدِ","en_gloss":"after","transliteration":"baʿdi","verse_key":"17:17"},{"pos":7,"ar":"نُوحٍۢ ۗ","en_gloss":"Nuh","transliteration":"nūḥin","verse_key":"17:17"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَكَفَىٰ","en_gloss":"And sufficient","transliteration":"wakafā","verse_key":"17:17"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بِرَبِّكَ","en_gloss":"(is) your Lord","transliteration":"birabbika","verse_key":"17:17"},{"pos":10,"ar":"بِذُنُوبِ","en_gloss":"concerning the sins","transliteration":"bidhunūbi","verse_key":"17:17"},{"pos":11,"ar":"عِبَادِهِۦ","en_gloss":"(of) His servants","transliteration":"ʿibādihi","verse_key":"17:17"},{"pos":12,"ar":"خَبِيرًۢا","en_gloss":"All-Aware","transliteration":"khabīran","verse_key":"17:17"},{"pos":13,"ar":"بَصِيرًۭا","en_gloss":"All-Seer","transliteration":"baṣīran","verse_key":"17:17"},{"pos":14,"ar":"١٧","en_gloss":"(17)","transliterati